) and floor drain, 9' ceilings on the main and basement, separate side entry, and LVP flooring throughout the main floor. The foyer leads to a full 3-piece bath with walk-in shower and a main-floor bedroom—ideal for guests, family, or office. A rear mudroom with built-in bench, hooks, and cubbies adds storage. The kitchen features quartz countertops, a large island with flush eating ledge, Silgranit sink, pendant lighting, built-in microwave, full-height backsplash, chimney hood fan, and ceiling-height cabinetry with soft-close doors.  A walk-through butler’s pantry with sink connects to the mudroom. The open-concept great room and nook offer large rear windows, an electric fireplace, backyard access, and open-to-below design. Upstairs includes a primary suite with 5-piece ensuite, bonus room, two bedrooms, full bath, and laundry. Includes black fixtures, upgraded railings, and basement rough-in plumbing. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$634,600"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","2,021 sq ft"],["Lot size","3,690 sq ft"],["Year built","2026"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Marquis"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5Y4K3"],["MLS® number","E4495998"],["Listed","June 27, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Microwave, Hood Fan, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Insert, Electric"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 4","Main level",""],["Bonus Room","Upper Level",""]],"courtesy":"David Lam, Exp Realty and Joe Tolvay, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"marquis","area":"northeast-edmonton"}